('deity.ugaritic.dagan','Dagan in Ugaritic texts','乌加里特文本中的达贡／达甘','Dagnu','Dagnu','DEITY','civ.ugaritic','region.levant','Late Bronze Age Ugarit','只按乌加里特文本中的神名与巴力亲属称谓建档，不与其他时期地方达贡传统粗暴合并。 / Witness-scoped Ugaritic Dagan dossier.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"regional_scope":"UGARITIC_TEXTS","merge_guard":"other Dagan/Dagon regional dossiers"}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z'),
('text.ugaritic.baal_cycle.ktu1_5','Baal Cycle tablet KTU 1.5','巴力组诗泥板 KTU 1.5','KTU 1.5','KTU 1.5','TABLET','civ.ugaritic','region.levant','Late thirteenth century BCE manuscript context','巴力—穆特阶段的独立泥板见证，馆藏组合 AO 16.641 + 16.642。 / Separate tablet witness for the Baal–Mot sequence.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"museum_numbers":["AO 16.641","AO 16.642"],"edition_status":"FORTHCOMING_2027_2029"}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z'),
('text.ugaritic.baal_cycle.ktu1_6','Baal Cycle tablet KTU 1.6','巴力组诗泥板 KTU 1.6','KTU 1.6','KTU 1.6','TABLET','civ.ugaritic','region.levant','Late thirteenth century BCE manuscript context','巴力—穆特阶段的独立泥板见证，馆藏号 AO 16.636。 / Separate tablet witness for the later Baal–Mot sequence.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"museum_numbers":["AO 16.636"],"edition_status":"FORTHCOMING_2027_2029"}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z'),
('event.ugaritic.baal_mot_ktu15_16','Baal and Mot sequence in KTU 1.5–1.6','巴力与穆特事件序列（KTU 1.5–1.6）',NULL,NULL,'EVENT','civ.ugaritic','region.levant','Late Bronze Age narrative witnessed by KTU 1.5–1.6','把争执、死亡／冥界与返回阶段登记为残缺文本序列，不简化为“巴力永久杀死死亡”。 / Fragmentary narrative sequence, not a timeless claim that Death was permanently destroyed.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"witnesses":["KTU 1.5","KTU 1.6"],"permanent_death_claim":false}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z'),
('creature.akkadian.anzu','Anzu of the Akkadian myth','阿卡德《安祖神话》中的安祖','Anzû','Anzû','MONSTER','civ.akkadian','region.mesopotamia','Second-to-first millennium BCE Akkadian witnesses','与《安祖神话》文本实体分开：这是叙事角色，不是泥板或现代图像。 / Narrative creature kept separate from the Anzu text and material representations.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"entity_layer":"MYTHIC_ACTOR","not_text":"text.akkadian.anzu"}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z'),
('deity.akkadian.ninurta','Ninurta in the Akkadian Anzu myth','阿卡德《安祖神话》中的宁努尔塔','Ninurta','Ninurta','DEITY','civ.akkadian','region.mesopotamia','Second-to-first millennium BCE Akkadian witnesses','本档聚焦《安祖神话》中击败安祖并收回命运泥板的角色。 / Dossier scoped to Ninurta’s role in the Akkadian Anzu myth.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"witness_scope":"AKKADIAN_ANZU_MYTH"}','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z','2026-08-27T13:00:00Z');

